Package: ProstateAtlasMapR
Title: Reference Mapping onto the Prostate Single-Cell Atlas
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lei", "Tang", email = "tanglei@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Build a lightweight reference from a prostate single-cell atlas
    and map new single-cell datasets onto it with Seurat's anchor-based
    workflow (FindTransferAnchors + MapQuery), while preserving the atlas
    umap.rpca coordinates. Users can choose annotation level H1/H2/H3 at
    mapping time. The lean reference object is distributed separately from
    this package (e.g. GitHub Releases or Zenodo).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
